        "r": 184.05982800000004,
        "b": 681.9831449281769
      },
      "content": "Meaning"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1599",
      "reading_order": 2104,
      "section": "1-19. Alarm AL-31",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.839556,
        "t": 673.8749720000001,
        "r": 527.3941259999995,
        "b": 648.023360928177
      },
      "content": "The motor cannot rotate at a specified speed. It rotates at very low speed, or even stops."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1600",
      "reading_order": 2105,
      "section": "1-19. Alarm AL-31",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.29964600000001,
        "t": 622.8751760000001,
        "r": 269.6837340000001,
        "b": 614.003456928177
      },
      "content": "Cause and corrective action"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1601",
      "reading_order": 2106,
      "section": "1-19. Alarm AL-31",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 106.37977800000002,
        "t": 605.8952840000002,
        "r": 205.725072,
        "b": 597.023564928177
      },
      "content": "Motor locked."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1602",
      "reading_order": 2107,
      "section": "1-19. Alarm AL-31",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.83955600000002,
        "t": 588.8552720000001,
        "r": 476.9744879999999,
        "b": 579.983552928177
      },
      "content": "Check whether the motor cannot accelerate because it is physically locked."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1603",
      "reading_order": 2108,
      "section": "1-19. Alarm AL-31",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.84,
        "t": 576.7402999999999,
        "r": 267.896598,
        "b": 562.0523
      },
      "content": "⇒ Remove the cause."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1604",
      "reading_order": 2109,
      "section": "1-19. Alarm AL-31",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 142.95120599999998,
        "t": 537.854756,
        "r": 314.2541280000003,
        "b": 528.9830369281768
      },
      "content": "Motor speed feedback cable defective"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1605",
      "reading_order": 2110,
      "section": "1-19. Alarm AL-31",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.839988,
        "t": 520.874864,
        "r": 429.3378359999999,
        "b": 512.0031449281769
      },
      "content": "Check the connection of the cable. Also check for a broken wire."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1606",
      "reading_order": 2111,
      "section": "1-19. Alarm AL-31",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.84,
        "t": 508.76030000000003,
        "r": 497.3690459999999,
        "b": 494.07230000000004
      },
      "content": "⇒ Connect the cable correctly. If any wire in the cable is broken, replace it"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1607",
      "reading_order": 2112,
      "section": "1-19. Alarm AL-31",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 106.379628,
        "t": 469.87475600000005,
        "r": 318.099222,
        "b": 461.0030369281768
      },
      "content": "Motor speed feedback signal abnormal"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1608",
      "reading_order": 2113,
      "section": "1-19. Alarm AL-31",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.839406,
        "t": 452.89486400000004,
        "r": 386.36949,
        "b": 444.0231449281768
      },
      "content": "Check the speed feedback signal with an oscilloscope."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1609",
      "reading_order": 2114,
      "section": "1-19. Alarm AL-31",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.84,
        "t": 440.7203,
        "r": 469.71384599999925,
        "b": 426.0323
      },
      "content": "⇒ Adjust so that the feedback signal level becomes the rated value."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1610",
      "reading_order": 2115,
      "section": "1-19. Alarm AL-31",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 106.37962800000005,
        "t": 401.894876,
        "r": 305.25959400000005,
        "b": 393.0231569281768
      },
      "content": "Incorrect power line wire connection"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1611",
      "reading_order": 2116,
      "section": "1-19. Alarm AL-31",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.83940600000005,
        "t": 384.854864,
        "r": 442.07768400000066,
        "b": 375.9831449281768
      },
      "content": "Check the connection of the power line wires (for phase order, etc.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1612",
      "reading_order": 2117,
      "section": "1-19. Alarm AL-31",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.84,
        "t": 372.7403,
        "r": 327.2995860000005,
        "b": 358.0523
      },
      "content": "⇒ Connect the power line correctly."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_1613",
      "reading_order": 2118,
      "section": "1-20. Alarm AL-32",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 70.91985,
        "t": 333.854756,
        "r": 168.59781599999997,
        "b": 324.9830369281767
      },
